### AccessBridge Accessibility Test

POST http://localhost:5000/api/accessibility/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "Applicants must submit a completed application form along with a valid identity proof and address proof. The application must be submitted before 5:00 PM on 30 September 2026. Applications submitted after the deadline may not be accepted.",
    "language": "en"
}
### Test Image Analyze API

POST http://localhost:5000/api/images/analyze
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----AccessBridgeImageBoundary

------AccessBridgeImageBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

en
------AccessBridgeImageBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="application-test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./uploads/application-test.jpg
